WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.600
Your finances. An interactive empire.
Explore an isometric world of buildings and assets.

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:14.200
Revisit your empire, month by month.
Choose a month and year to inspect historical records.

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:23.800
Give every asset its numbers.
Manage property value, debt, and monthly passive income.

00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.400
Make changes with context.
Historical edits include a confirmation before rewriting later history.

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:36.000
See the bigger picture.
Inspect the empire’s financial summary.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:40.600
Understand each property.
Open individual buildings to review their asset metrics.

00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:47.200
PASSIVE EMPIRE
